{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "26c56683-20ee-8c28-adbf-715dbd2fc7b0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T11:15:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gloria Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:13:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:13:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling about a streetlight that's out. Well, I think it's the light by the crosswalk, and the whole crosswalk is dark at night now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a streetlight out at a crosswalk. Can you tell me where that is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's right in front of 417 Dean Avenue. If you're coming from the main road, you turn at where the bank used to be and it's maybe a block down on the left."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Four seventeen Dean Avenue, the crosswalk right out front. And that's in the Fifth Ward, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is the light completely out, or does it flicker on and off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Completely out. It's been dark the last few nights. I walk across there in the evening and I honestly don't feel safe. Cars can't really see you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Do you know if there's a number on the pole? Sometimes there's a small tag at about eye level."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me think. I didn't look. I can go check, but I'm in the car right now. I don't think I can read it from here anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. The address is enough for us to find it. So you'd like a crew to check the pole and see what's wrong with the light."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, if someone could come look at the pole. And I'm new to the area, I only moved here recently, so I'm still learning how everything works. I'd appreciate your patience if I'm not explaining it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You explained it fine. Welcome to Newport. Can I get a phone number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight three. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:34-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gloria Quintero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Gloria. I'm putting in the request now for the dark light at the crosswalk at 417 Dean Avenue. It goes to the crew that handles streetlights."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care crossing in the meantime."
    }
  ],
